# Archive perfected motion

If 媽媽 says 「此動畫效果已完善」 (or close wording):

1. Name the animation just finished in this chat in 中文 (e.g. 星鏈局部展開).
2. Set `kind`: `single` 單一 / `local` 局部（多段組合） / `transit` 轉場（換頁）.
3. Pull the real keyframes and selectors from the files you just wrote. Add a small isolated `html` + `css` preview that can replay inside the 軌跡 lab iframe. Do not dump all of `index.css`.
4. Upsert `data/motions.json` by `id`. Keep `source` as the production files/selectors.
5. Do not write lab edits back into production CSS. The 軌跡 experiment iframe is isolated on purpose.

Shape: `{ id, name, kind, blurb, source, html, css }`.
